do Global.cam_switch_to_static(20)
set {npc_name2} = "Bayon Sha"
do Global.stop_movement()
Townsfolk2: [portrait=Bayon]**Stealth blunder (1d20+11)**
Townsfolk2: [portrait=Bayon](Shit, she saw me!)
Veska: [portrait=serious]Excuse me?
Townsfolk2: [portrait=Bayon]Don't you know who I am?
Veska: [portrait=frown]Should I...?
Townsfolk2: [portrait=Bayon]Ah...
[wait time="1.0"]
Townsfolk2: [portrait=Bayon]Pffft-- HAHAHAHA. No, girl, you shouldn't.
Townsfolk2: [portrait=Bayon]I'm sorry, I think I confused you with someone.
Townsfolk2: [portrait=Bayon]Truth be told... the fact that I'm even here is a bad joke.
Townsfolk2: [portrait=Bayon]It strikes me as bordering on inconsiderate that you are even here. This is neither your story nor mine. It is not our place to be here.
Veska: [portrait=frown](Didn't yo say you didn't know me?)
Townsfolk2: [portrait=Bayon]But what can you do?
Townsfolk2: [portrait=Bayon]I can't lie... Seeing Númena with my own two eyes, stepping this ground, hearing its people...
Townsfolk2: [portrait=Bayon]I can't help but feel a bit grateful.
Townsfolk2: [portrait=Bayon]At least I can rest easy knowing that Grand Marquis Bayon Sha managed to fix some of his many screw-ups...
Townsfolk2: [portrait=Bayon]Somewhat...
Veska: [portrait=frown]...
Veska: [portrait=frown]What a weird guy...
Veska: [portrait=frown]Better leave him alone.
do Dialogic.start_timeline("check_transition_TL")
